could support an FTC Act Section 5 theory if materially inconsistent with observed operation.

Identify the exact representation required; do not infer deception merely from malfunction.

4. HIPAA
Determine whether Apple would be a covered entity or business associate in the factual configuration at issue.

Do not assume that processing information on a device used by a healthcare professional creates HIPAA jurisdiction.

5. STATE LAW
Research potentially applicable state disability/civil-rights and consumer-protection law, including:
- California Unruh Civil Rights Act;
- California Disabled Persons Act if applicable;
- Texas disability/public-accommodation law if applicable;
